  "description": "Implements every sub-issue of a spec in dependency waves. Run input: the spec issue number (for example \"100\"). Start it in a NEW worktree based on development. Setup pushes spec/<n> and opens a draft spec PR; each wave fans out Ticket Implementation (2 at a time) with PRs into spec/<n>, merges the green ones, and loops until every ticket is done; then the spec PR leaves draft and waits for CI, with an investigate/fix loop. Humans are asked only when tickets fail or no ticket can start. Requires the sub-issues to carry GitHub blocked-by dependencies.",
  "entryNodeId": "setup",
  "schemaVersion": 1
}
